# The Cone phone app's build-time configuration (cone-buzz-infra Slice 43 decision 4, ADR-428): every line
# becomes one --dart-define of every build recipe, and cone/mobile/build-env.sh refuses any name not listed in
# it. No secret belongs here. BUZZ_RELAY_URL is the pinned client's fallback while no community is active
# (mobile/lib/shared/relay/relay_provider.dart), so a Cone build never points at upstream's localhost default.
# Deliberately absent: BUZZ_PUSH_GATEWAY_URL (no push yet), BUZZ_DISTRIBUTION, BUZZ_BUILDERLAB_URL and
# BUZZ_BUILDERLAB_RELAYS (Builderlab off).
BUZZ_RELAY_URL=https://buzz.cone.digital
